    {
      "subId": "1913105",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191310501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191310501": {
            "id": "191310501",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310502"
            ]
          },
          "191310502": {
            "id": "191310502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(test)凝光！起床啦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310503"
            ]
          },
          "191310503": {
            "id": "191310503",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)我起来了。今天给我安排了什么行程呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310504"
            ]
          },
          "191310504": {
            "id": "191310504",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)今天放个假吧，我们去休息！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310505"
            ]
          },
          "191310505": {
            "id": "191310505",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)哦？放假？也好，我也很久没有休闲了。那我们要去做什么呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310598"
            ]
          },
          "191310598": {
            "id": "191310598",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(test)凝光有没有一直想做的事？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310599"
            ]
          },
          "191310599": {
            "id": "191310599",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(test)凝光有没有最近在考虑的事情？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1913106",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191310601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191310601": {
            "id": "191310601",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)嗯……我最近一直想做一套新的棋戏。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310602"
            ]
          },
          "191310602": {
            "id": "191310602",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)我还想把你做成其中一颗棋子呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310603"
            ]
          },
          "191310603": {
            "id": "191310603",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(test)我吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310604"
            ]
          },
          "191310604": {
            "id": "191310604",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)对，就是你。走吧，我们去春香窑找我的一个老相识。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1913107",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191310701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191310701": {
            "id": "191310701",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)一直想做的事吗……我倒是一直想体会一下白手起家重新创业的感觉，找回一下当时的激情。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310702"
            ]
          },
          "191310702": {
            "id": "191310702",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)如果我不用任何现在的资源重新开始，不知道能做到哪一步？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310703"
            ]
          },
          "191310703": {
            "id": "191310703",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)你觉得我白手起家，应该能做点什么呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310798"
            ]
          },
          "191310798": {
            "id": "191310798",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(test)凝光这么懂商业，我觉得可以试试去北国银行当金融顾问。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310799"
            ]
          },
          "191310799": {
            "id": "191310799",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(test)我们可以去试试收破烂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1913108",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191310801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191310801": {
            "id": "191310801",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)废品生意吗？倒也是一种稳妥的办法。那我们这就动身吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310802"
            ]
          },
          "191310802": {
            "id": "191310802",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)码头的仓库管理员狗三儿那里应该每天都会处理一些不用的东西，我们去问问他吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1913109",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191310901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191310901": {
            "id": "191310901",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)你确定北国银行会让我去给他们当顾问？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191310902"
            ]
          },
          "191310902": {
            "id": "191310902",
            "speakerId": 10211,
            "speakerName": "凝光",
            "text": "(test)不过既然是你的提议，我们去看看也无妨。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
